    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f RAIDBOUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tactical Viking Auto-Battler with Roguelite Worker Placement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Raidbound</i>, you lead a clan of fearless Vikings through a mythic gauntlet of combat, sacrifice, and divine favor. This is no idle expedition\u2014each decision shapes the fate of your warband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your warriors from the Tavern, train them in the ways of battle, and prepare them for war. Infuse them with ancient runes, forge legendary weapons, or sacrifice them to strengthen the clan. Once your energy for the year is spent, you must Raid\u2014battling another player\u2019s clan in asynchronous auto-combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, travel across a living map of strategic Nodes. Each offers a different boon\u2014or risk. The road to glory is yours to choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/8ddea3d99eeb6f1b35fa2230d31d9f20.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/8ddea3d99eeb6f1b35fa2230d31d9f20.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/8ddea3d99eeb6f1b35fa2230d31d9f20.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Vikings &amp; Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Viking joins your clan with a unique ability and one of four roles:<br><strong>Raider</strong>, <strong>Warden</strong>, <strong>Berserker</strong>, or <strong>Skirmisher</strong>.<br>Roles create synergies\u2014like Wardens granting bonus armor when grouped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can equip up to 4 abilities per Viking, unlocked by infusing them with Runes.<br>Combat is fully automated, but strategic: Vikings attack based on speed, targeting (frontline, backline, or random), and ability loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose a <strong>Raid</strong>, and you lose a life. When you\u2019re out\u2014your run ends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/40a3f610fbdda7461f9750f69da59254.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/40a3f610fbdda7461f9750f69da59254.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/40a3f610fbdda7461f9750f69da59254.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 HERO PASSIVES &amp; ABILITY SYNERGIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run, choose from a variety of <strong>hero powers</strong> that shape your overall strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passives range from <strong>tank-saving effects</strong> to <strong>formation-breaking wildcards</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack <strong>buffs, status effects, and rune enhancements</strong> to create emergent combos across your Vikings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay value comes from <strong>mixing heroes, drafting new powers</strong>, and discovering devastating synergy chains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/f0461ccf8f19f6eb4bf9c338376ff394.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/f0461ccf8f19f6eb4bf9c338376ff394.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/f0461ccf8f19f6eb4bf9c338376ff394.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude93 RUNE-ENHANCED CREW SYSTEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn and equip powerful <strong>Runes</strong> to augment your Vikings with effects like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn, poison, bleed, freeze, haste, armor, and more.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes are <strong>consumable power boosts</strong> \u2014 merge them to forge stronger variants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build run-specific loadouts to <strong>adapt to enemy types and draft RNG</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/d6049cd43d8ce10eb8c98e24c7ac5cc7.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/d6049cd43d8ce10eb8c98e24c7ac5cc7.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/d6049cd43d8ce10eb8c98e24c7ac5cc7.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd01 ROGUELITE PROGRESSION LOOP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a series of <strong>PvE and PvP rounds</strong>, each more intense than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losing a PvP battle costs health \u2014 but clever planning ensures you stay in the fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each victory earns rewards and choices that evolve your strategy for the next encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs end when all Vikings fall\u2026 or you become a <strong>legend of the leaderboard</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/6f64f6342a86e6bbf95971e7e62f74a2.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/6f64f6342a86e6bbf95971e7e62f74a2.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/6f64f6342a86e6bbf95971e7e62f74a2.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/269bdd750db3e931ada9fb17c8f95140.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/269bdd750db3e931ada9fb17c8f95140.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/269bdd750db3e931ada9fb17c8f95140.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f CHOOSE YOUR PATH: KEY NODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sparring Pit</strong> \u2013 Face rival clans to earn gold and glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting Grounds</strong> \u2013 Hunt prey to gather rations and empower future recruits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Mine</strong> \u2013 Mine ore safely\u2026 or risk it all for a greater haul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacksmith</strong> \u2013 Forge weapons and armor to power up your entire warband.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odin\u2019s Trial</strong> \u2013 Send one Viking to receive a divine gift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritual Site</strong> \u2013 Sacrifice a Viking; their strength flows into the rest of your clan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elite Sparring Pit</strong> \u2013 Face stronger foes for greater rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runesmith</strong> \u2013 Choose one of three powerful runes to permanently enhance a Viking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gambler\u2019s Den\u00a0(Post-Demo)</strong> \u2013 Risk any resource\u2014gold, rations, even lives\u2014for a chance at glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voyage\u00a0(Post-Demo)</strong> \u2013 Set sail to earn powerful relics, if you can brave the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thor\u2019s Blessing</strong> \u2013 Gain extra energy to extend your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystic (Post-Demo)</strong> \u2013 Revisit previously used nodes for greater flexibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden\u00a0\u2013</strong>\u00a0Adding more post demo release</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/76c683e9cdead8688f2b7393c28677c4.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/76c683e9cdead8688f2b7393c28677c4.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/76c683e9cdead8688f2b7393c28677c4.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2696\ufe0f Dishonor &amp; Rerolls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Gods offer choices, you may not always agree.<br>Spend <strong>glory</strong> to reroll\u2014but each reroll increases <strong>Dishonor</strong>, making future choices riskier and more expensive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/627a3a561be9e66cdf9550559d4f599f.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/627a3a561be9e66cdf9550559d4f599f.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/627a3a561be9e66cdf9550559d4f599f.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Deep tactical auto-battler with <strong>formation and cooldown-focused combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Strategic draft system and <strong>hero-defining passive powers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude84 Merge and manipulate Runes for <strong>customizable Viking effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Unique Viking classes and abilities with <strong>synergy-driven gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Mix of PvE encounters and <strong>async PvP battles</strong> with ranked opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1 No microtransactions \u2013 a <strong>fully premium, progression-based experience</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/936ef2e4daf706dfb1bd812b15387fd5.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/936ef2e4daf706dfb1bd812b15387fd5.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/936ef2e4daf706dfb1bd812b15387fd5.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Node Upgrades (Post-Demo)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In future versions, nodes can be upgraded. Spend gold, rations, or glory to boost output\u2014like doubling the Blacksmith\u2019s power or gaining more control over your hunts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your clan survive the chaos? Or will your saga be lost in the mist?</strong> <strong>Prepare your warband. Forge your legacy. Become\u2026 <i>Raidbound</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f RAIDBOUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tactical Viking Auto-Battler with Roguelite Worker Placement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Raidbound</i>, you lead a clan of fearless Vikings through a mythic gauntlet of combat, sacrifice, and divine favor. This is no idle expedition\u2014each decision shapes the fate of your warband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your warriors from the Tavern, train them in the ways of battle, and prepare them for war. Infuse them with ancient runes, forge legendary weapons, or sacrifice them to strengthen the clan. Once your energy for the year is spent, you must Raid\u2014battling another player\u2019s clan in asynchronous auto-combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, travel across a living map of strategic Nodes. Each offers a different boon\u2014or risk. The road to glory is yours to choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/8ddea3d99eeb6f1b35fa2230d31d9f20.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/8ddea3d99eeb6f1b35fa2230d31d9f20.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/8ddea3d99eeb6f1b35fa2230d31d9f20.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Vikings &amp; Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Viking joins your clan with a unique ability and one of four roles:<br><strong>Raider</strong>, <strong>Warden</strong>, <strong>Berserker</strong>, or <strong>Skirmisher</strong>.<br>Roles create synergies\u2014like Wardens granting bonus armor when grouped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can equip up to 4 abilities per Viking, unlocked by infusing them with Runes.<br>Combat is fully automated, but strategic: Vikings attack based on speed, targeting (frontline, backline, or random), and ability loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose a <strong>Raid</strong>, and you lose a life. When you\u2019re out\u2014your run ends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/40a3f610fbdda7461f9750f69da59254.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/40a3f610fbdda7461f9750f69da59254.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/40a3f610fbdda7461f9750f69da59254.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 HERO PASSIVES &amp; ABILITY SYNERGIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run, choose from a variety of <strong>hero powers</strong> that shape your overall strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passives range from <strong>tank-saving effects</strong> to <strong>formation-breaking wildcards</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack <strong>buffs, status effects, and rune enhancements</strong> to create emergent combos across your Vikings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay value comes from <strong>mixing heroes, drafting new powers</strong>, and discovering devastating synergy chains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/f0461ccf8f19f6eb4bf9c338376ff394.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/f0461ccf8f19f6eb4bf9c338376ff394.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/f0461ccf8f19f6eb4bf9c338376ff394.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude93 RUNE-ENHANCED CREW SYSTEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn and equip powerful <strong>Runes</strong> to augment your Vikings with effects like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn, poison, bleed, freeze, haste, armor, and more.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes are <strong>consumable power boosts</strong> \u2014 merge them to forge stronger variants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build run-specific loadouts to <strong>adapt to enemy types and draft RNG</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/d6049cd43d8ce10eb8c98e24c7ac5cc7.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/d6049cd43d8ce10eb8c98e24c7ac5cc7.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/d6049cd43d8ce10eb8c98e24c7ac5cc7.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd01 ROGUELITE PROGRESSION LOOP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a series of <strong>PvE and PvP rounds</strong>, each more intense than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losing a PvP battle costs health \u2014 but clever planning ensures you stay in the fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each victory earns rewards and choices that evolve your strategy for the next encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs end when all Vikings fall\u2026 or you become a <strong>legend of the leaderboard</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/6f64f6342a86e6bbf95971e7e62f74a2.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/6f64f6342a86e6bbf95971e7e62f74a2.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/6f64f6342a86e6bbf95971e7e62f74a2.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/269bdd750db3e931ada9fb17c8f95140.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/269bdd750db3e931ada9fb17c8f95140.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/269bdd750db3e931ada9fb17c8f95140.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f CHOOSE YOUR PATH: KEY NODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sparring Pit</strong> \u2013 Face rival clans to earn gold and glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting Grounds</strong> \u2013 Hunt prey to gather rations and empower future recruits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Mine</strong> \u2013 Mine ore safely\u2026 or risk it all for a greater haul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacksmith</strong> \u2013 Forge weapons and armor to power up your entire warband.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odin\u2019s Trial</strong> \u2013 Send one Viking to receive a divine gift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritual Site</strong> \u2013 Sacrifice a Viking; their strength flows into the rest of your clan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elite Sparring Pit</strong> \u2013 Face stronger foes for greater rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runesmith</strong> \u2013 Choose one of three powerful runes to permanently enhance a Viking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gambler\u2019s Den\u00a0(Post-Demo)</strong> \u2013 Risk any resource\u2014gold, rations, even lives\u2014for a chance at glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voyage\u00a0(Post-Demo)</strong> \u2013 Set sail to earn powerful relics, if you can brave the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thor\u2019s Blessing</strong> \u2013 Gain extra energy to extend your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystic (Post-Demo)</strong> \u2013 Revisit previously used nodes for greater flexibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden\u00a0\u2013</strong>\u00a0Adding more post demo release</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/76c683e9cdead8688f2b7393c28677c4.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/76c683e9cdead8688f2b7393c28677c4.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/76c683e9cdead8688f2b7393c28677c4.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2696\ufe0f Dishonor &amp; Rerolls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Gods offer choices, you may not always agree.<br>Spend <strong>glory</strong> to reroll\u2014but each reroll increases <strong>Dishonor</strong>, making future choices riskier and more expensive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/627a3a561be9e66cdf9550559d4f599f.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/627a3a561be9e66cdf9550559d4f599f.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/627a3a561be9e66cdf9550559d4f599f.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Deep tactical auto-battler with <strong>formation and cooldown-focused combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Strategic draft system and <strong>hero-defining passive powers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude84 Merge and manipulate Runes for <strong>customizable Viking effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Unique Viking classes and abilities with <strong>synergy-driven gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Mix of PvE encounters and <strong>async PvP battles</strong> with ranked opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1 No microtransactions \u2013 a <strong>fully premium, progression-based experience</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/936ef2e4daf706dfb1bd812b15387fd5.poster.avif?t=1755030190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/936ef2e4daf706dfb1bd812b15387fd5.webm?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/936ef2e4daf706dfb1bd812b15387fd5.mp4?t=1755030190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Node Upgrades (Post-Demo)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In future versions, nodes can be upgraded. Spend gold, rations, or glory to boost output\u2014like doubling the Blacksmith\u2019s power or gaining more control over your hunts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your clan survive the chaos? Or will your saga be lost in the mist?</strong> <strong>Prepare your warband. Forge your legacy. Become\u2026 <i>Raidbound</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Raidbound is a Viking-themed auto-battler with a worker placement style system. Recruit warriors, forge gear, sacrifice for power, and raid rival clans. Choose your path, build your warband, and earn glory across a mythic map of tactical choices.",
